{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discard</strong> - it is a sci-fi puzzle 2D-platformer inspired by old-school cinematic platformers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must solve problems in order to survive on this dangerous planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/1.gif?t=1744470750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Discover new areas to explore and secrets to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Solve puzzles to escape. One wrong move could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/2.gif?t=1744470750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 A World Alive with Danger: Explore diverse zones, from underground labs to desert ruins, each teeming with unique hazards, enemies, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/3.gif?t=1744470750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Discard</strong> is a spiritual successor to classic cinematic platformers such as Prince of Persia and Flashback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/4.gif?t=1744470750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/add_to_wishlist.png?t=1744470750\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590480?t=1744470750","background_raw":"htt